<custom_item>
  type        : SQL_POLICY
  description : "1.0034 - SQL - MSSQL - Login Auditing is set to failed logins"
  info        : "This setting will record failed authentication attempts for SQL Server logins to the SQL Server Errorlog."
  solution    : "Configure this setting to the expected baseline value shown in the control description and value_data."
  reference   : "NIST 800-53r5|AU-1 AU-2"
  see_also    : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
